model g6_refusal_order_three
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-31
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31
  note "T, pre-M1 (#97, chunk 4, P13): three plan moves a, b and c, one leg each on one day into gone after its lifespan ends (RUN-LIFESPAN), all refused at src: src keeps the first refusal booked, the first of the three in the typed movement order (E §4.1, tally 2.1.6, #57). g6/refusal_order holds two; its twin one"

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money DUK

input d0: date

place src: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place gone: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..2025-01-05

move a: transfers
  on d0
  leg cash from src to gone amount amt

move b: transfers
  on d0
  leg cash from src to gone amount amt

move c: transfers
  on d0
  leg cash from src to gone amount amt

ask q: bal(src, 2025-01-31)

version facts
  cite fixture
